      "content": "LITTLE GADDESDEN       \tASHRIDGE PARK SP 91 SE  \t\t\t\t\t(West side) 1/177                                   \tBarn at Old Park -                                      \t\tLodge (40m to NNW of Lodge) GV                                     \t\tII Barn. C17. Timber frame dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roof. A 3-bays barn facing S with later lean-to extension on E end now the  entry.  Jowled  posts,  straight  braces  to  tie-beams.  Angled queen-strut trusses in clasped-purlin roof without collars. Some brick infill to frame. Listing NGR: SP9841812806"
    }
